{"4199680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DUSTMOON", "steam_appid": 4199680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DUSTMOON&quot; is an adventure card game with a space future card theme, integrating Roguelike deck building. There is also a special 3DUI visual experience. You will join any force, recruit teammates who can change the situation, build what you think is the most unparalleled skill deck, and flexibly respond to unique events in each round of team adventure. And most importantly, the next time you start, you might also play the role of an opponent you have defeated before... Who will you represent this time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/671d2c9ee14fcaece6f8579d1b69fdf3.poster.avif?t=1767928659\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/671d2c9ee14fcaece6f8579d1b69fdf3.webm?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/671d2c9ee14fcaece6f8579d1b69fdf3.mp4?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>In &quot;DUSTMOON&quot;, players can...</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the battles of villains with different characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/a24302005ceb9beb7798c39512f71bc3.poster.avif?t=1767928659\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/a24302005ceb9beb7798c39512f71bc3.webm?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/a24302005ceb9beb7798c39512f71bc3.mp4?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck formed by recruiting teammates and obtaining new skill cards through random events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/21dca926c53136f0e60d9f3ab4699fea.poster.avif?t=1767928659\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/21dca926c53136f0e60d9f3ab4699fea.webm?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer other power regions, climb the White Tower, and uncover the secrets hidden on the far side of the moon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/560f8be2063e734acb339b3cb9c61a5d.poster.avif?t=1767928659\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199680/extras/560f8be2063e734acb339b3cb9c61a5d.webm?t=1767928659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DUSTMOON&quot; is an adventure card game with a space future card theme, integrating Roguelike deck building. There is also a special 3DUI visual experience. You will join any force, recruit teammates who can change the situation, build what you think is the most unparalleled skill deck, and flexibly 